  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><h3>• About our brand and products:</h3><p>Javooy Divine Secret is a luxury lifestyle brand rooted in <strong>self-care, beauty, mystery, and intentional living</strong>. Our collections include curated mystery boxes, elegant home &amp; lifestyle essentials, and divine little luxuries designed to elevate everyday moments. Every product is chosen to feel special, aesthetic, and gift-worthy — made for unboxing, sharing, and falling in love with.</p><hr><h3>• What makes us different:</h3><p>We don’t just sell products — we create an <strong>experience</strong>.<br>From our signature <strong>mystery boxes</strong> to our soft luxury aesthetic, JDS is about surprise, emotion, and connection. Affiliates get <strong>creative freedom</strong>, exclusive drops, and the chance to be part of a growing divine community that values authenticity over pushy sales.</p><hr><h3>• How affiliates can earn:</h3><p>Affiliates earn <strong>commission on every sale</strong> made through their unique affiliate link or QR code.<br>Once your content is live, your link keeps working for you — allowing you to earn <strong>residual income</strong> as long as customers shop through your link ✨</p><hr><h3>• How to promote us:</h3><p>You can promote JDS in a way that feels natural to you:</p><ul><li><p>Mystery box unboxings</p></li><li><p>Product reviews</p></li><li><p>Lifestyle, self-care, or aesthetic content</p></li><li><p>TikTok, Instagram posts, stories, or bio links</p></li><li><p>QR codes added to videos or posts</p></li></ul><p>You have full <strong>creative freedom</strong> — we trust your style and your audience.</p><hr><h3>• Other information:</h3><ul><li><p>Free to join</p></li><li><p>No minimum posting requirements</p></li><li><p>Worldwide audience</p></li><li><p>Affiliate dashboard to track clicks &amp; earnings</p></li><li><p>Supportive brand communication</p></li><li><p>Long-term collaboration opportunities for top creators</p></li></ul><p>✨ Join us and turn beauty, mystery, and content into income.</p></div></div>",
